  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Combine UiPath and Camunda for Advanced RPA Bot Orchestration",
    "splashDescription": "Revolutionize robotic process automation (RPA) bot orchestration with the UiPath Connector for Camunda. This Connector enhances your RPA capabilities by allowing Camunda to interact directly with UiPath bots. Now you can easily create queue items in UiPath and retrieve their results within your Camunda-powered, end-to-end business processes.",
